Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:52.64,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1653,420)}Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's said that many Spirit Beasts live in the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most cultivators here don't follow common sense
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,and only value strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are very few women.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once a woman is discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,terrible things will happen to her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,unless she has powerful backing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,She is mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:54.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Middle stage Foundation Establishment ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:02.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 3 of them !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the territory of the Fighting Evil Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you're smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,then leave that female to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nonsense... Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,How ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that cultivators here don't follow reason
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and only value strength ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you just used...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,was it the Death Spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Death Spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I once read in the Luo River Sect's scripture pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,that a vicious spell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the demonic path existed in ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivating it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,required merging 3 energies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first energy was yin energy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,by using a woman's Primordial Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.04,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: Primordial Yin = virginity
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,through dual cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second energy was death energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third was killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Merge these 3 energies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and escape death 9 times
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to master the Death Spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The chance of succeeding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:16.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is almost zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really similar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Death Spell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is likely an imitation of the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for concealing the Ji Realm's existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the Heaven Separating Pill is refined
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I reach Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you think of escaping...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:37.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't blame me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is even more terrifying than cultivators of the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,An abandoned cave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mountains in the Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,are hard to excavate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's find another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,His Divine Sense
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,can control over 30 flying swords simultaneously !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is pretty ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can only resist Foundation Establishment cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I plan to stay in this cave long-term.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the formation is broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can easily escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you will have to rely on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:54.40,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: The Eight Chinese Trigrams have various different meanings in Feng Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:45.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian: Triple lines
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kun: Six fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhen: Upside bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gen: Downside bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li: Hollow bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kan: Full bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dui: Open top
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xun: Open bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(231,632)}3 hours later
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are now 214 formations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used bones of crystal beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make the Nine Bones Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation is only at 30% power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,To make it stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,we need more bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:40.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You first...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Judging by this cave's condition,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,a cultivator was here before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,should I refine the Heaven Separating Pill now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't consume
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the pills you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can I earn your trust ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to give me your Soul Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I won't make it too difficult for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just refine enough pills for me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reach Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll escort you out of the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here are the materials I have,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,see what you can refine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:56.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is Desolate Wood Root,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Yellow Core Grass...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:08:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Spirit Grass !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can freely use all these materials ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only want pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can do whatever you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior can rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,With these materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can refine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,approximately 300 Yellow Spirit Pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,50 Poison Resistance Pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and various other pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,look at this Demon Blood Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:23.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It used to be the core ingredient of the Heaven Separating Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,refining the pills will take considerable time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nine Bones Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,probably won't last that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I plan on making a trip outside
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,to look for more bones for the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll come back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,in 3 days, maybe a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The artifact crafting technique of the War God Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,also requires Spirit Beast skulls for reaction furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:43.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,also find me a pill furnace ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:53.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pill furnace I carry can only refine ordinary pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Usually, Heaven Separating Pills
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,were refined in the sect's Heaven Fusing Furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to the map,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should be able to find bones around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:25.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1631,543)\fad(300,300)}Sang Muya\NFighting Evil Sect disciple\N15th layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I painstakingly prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:28.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,these 16 deadly poisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're not young anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't you help your Junior Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,by letting me use Foundation Stealing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to devour you !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sang Muya,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,you bastard !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,aren't you afraid of Master ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just following the tradition
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Fighting Evil Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master has already tacitly approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had my Divine Sense
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,spread out to scan the area
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I didn't detect him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sang Muya of the Fighting Evil Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,greets Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Senior was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:20.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,how can I help you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:31.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where did you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,find your beast bones ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:36.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,we were in the outskirts of the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:40.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to a more central area
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:43.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,were there are more Spirit Beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and thus more bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,He probably isn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,has 3 very dangerous areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Corpse Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:12:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spirit beasts often come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,New corpses of beasts are found here regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,what killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This must be the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:20.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now die !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are hundreds of souls in that flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess I can feed them to Xu Liguo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The quality of the bones is too poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess I need to explore a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:58.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if the bones here aren't top quality,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,they can still strengthen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Nine Bones Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems like yin energy is gathering here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This valley
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is completely different from the previous one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it appears calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's one of the most dangerous places
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,There must be some kind of danger here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Flood Dragon !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Flood Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,is probably even stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,than a Nascent Soul cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(960,492)}10 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,He said 3 days
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's already been 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will the bones
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,of this Flood Dragon be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:37.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Flood Dragon bones
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the formation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,will resist Core Formation cultivators for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even Nascent Soul cultivators will struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,can't be called the Nine Bones Formation anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Nine Dragon Bones Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are the Flood Dragon's Core and marrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Core is a natural pill
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and has healing properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The marrow is even more precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's concentrated spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:34.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.04,Earth Yin,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(961,436)}Grade 2\NEarth Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it can't compare to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Grade 4 Earth Yin in the Corpse Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's enough to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Underworld Ascension Method.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to prepare for Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,My second Cold Core condensed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:46.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll see where you run off to this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sea of Devils is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Flood Dragon skin is resistant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and poison-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of crafting it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that Senior
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,may use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Senior still doubts me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can throw it outside the cave
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to strengthen the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need one,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,keep the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:47.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(960,484)}3 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestral meridian,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Qi Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Dantian
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,will each condense a Cold Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:02.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Underworld Ascension Method merges the 3 Cold Cores.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,After they've merged,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have a chance to breakthrough to Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,by forming your true Golden Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still can't merge the Cold Cores...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, oh Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Normally, I can only appear when summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now that you're unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,it seems my chance for freedom has finally come !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:08.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.19,0:20:08.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:14.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:14.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:20.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:25.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:31.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:31.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.65,0:20:36.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:36.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:42.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:42.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:47.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:47.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:50.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:53.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:59.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.55,0:20:59.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:02.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.41,0:21:05.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:10.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:10.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:13.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:16.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:22.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:22.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:25.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:28.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:34.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.77,0:21:34.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
